{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31114","headline":"监郡犍爲舟中寓题寄同舍 · 薛能","name":"监郡犍爲舟中寓题寄同舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一寝闲身万事空，任天敎作假文翁。\n旗穿岛树孤舟上，家在山亭每日中。\n叠果盘飱丹橘地，若花牀席早梅风。\n佳期说尽君应笑，刘表尊前且不同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}